==English==

===Etymology===
From {{confix|electro|phoresis}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|electrophoreses|-}}

# the [[migration]] of [[electrically]] [[charge]]d [[molecule]]s through a [[medium]] under the [[influence]] of an [[electric]] [[field]]
# a [[method]] for the [[separation]] and [[analysis]] of large [[molecule]]s (such as [[protein]]s) by migrating a [[colloidal]] [[solution]] of them through a [[gel]]; [[gel electrophoresis]]

